{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mom6_kpp",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the MOM6 CVMix KPP planetary boundary layer parameterization (MOM6 dev/ncar_260909 @301879336, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-mom6 branch instrument/mom6-dumps; run configuration C_JRA_t62_mom6_inst: RI_CRIT=0.3, VON_KARMAN=0.4, SURF_LAYER_EXTENT=0.1, MINIMUM_OBL_DEPTH=5.0, MINIMUM_VT2=1e-10, INTERP_TYPE=quadratic, INTERP_TYPE2=LMD94, MATCH_TECHNIQUE=MatchGradient, ENHANCE_DIFFUSION=False, NLT_SHAPE=CVMix, N_SMOOTH=3, COMPUTE_MONIN_OBUKHOV=True, COMPUTE_EKMAN=False, USE_KPP_LT_K/VT2=False, KPP_IS_ADDITIVE=False, KPP_SHORTWAVE_METHOD=MXL_SW, l_LMD_ws=false, lnoDGat1=true, all unit rescale factors 1.0). Two models: KPPBLD reproduces KPP_compute_BLD (MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:1195-1575) down to the pre-smoothing OBL depth and kOBL — the surface-layer averages (F90:1342-1405), the per-assumed-OBL hydrostatic pressure for the Wright 1997 EOS (F90:1428-1440, EOS laws imported from ./mom6_templates.esm with the 15 coefficients declared as parameters), deltaBuoy/N2/N (F90:1444-1457), w_s/Vt^2/BulkRi (F90:1509-1550 via the ./mom6_kpp_templates.esm laws), and OBL_depth_low/kOBL (cvmix_kpp.F90:1585-1814, 1821-1867) with the quadratic interpolation, the Monin-Obukhov limit, the minOBLdepth floor and the MOM6 top/bottom bounds. KPPCoefs reproduces cvmix_coeffs_kpp_low (cvmix_kpp.F90:701-1298, not lStokesMOST, MatchGradient, ENHANCE_DIFFUSION=False: the no-match shape G(sigma) = sigma*(1-sigma)^2, the diffusivity/viscosity overwrite at interfaces 2..floor(kOBL), the KPP_IS_ADDITIVE=False replacement of nonzero entries, and the CVMix non-local term) driven by the SMOOTHED OBLdepth/kOBL, z_inter, uStar, surfBuoyFlux (MXL_SW) and the incoming Kt/Ks/Kv from mom6_kpp.csv. Pins: mom6_kpp_obl.csv rows for BulkRi/deltaU2/N2/z_cell/z_inter/OBLdepth/kOBL (rel 1e-12; the N_SMOOTH=3 Laplacian smoothing of KPP_smooth_BLD is inherently horizontal and is NOT reproduced — the pre-smoothing values are pinned and the smoothed values are consumed as inputs), and mom6_kpp.csv rows for Kd_heat/Kd_salt/Kv/NLT/Kt_out/Ks_out/Kv_out. Unpinned (never exercised by the 156 traced columns; see README-mom6.md): the OBL_limit branch (no traced column has BulkRi <= 0.3 everywhere, kfirst = N_LAYER+1), the interpolated OBL depth for the kfirst = 2 two-point quadratic (always floored to MINIMUM_OBL_DEPTH in the traces), the unstable (surfBuoyFlux < 0) branches of the stability functions and of the non-local term, the Langmuir enhancement paths, and the MINIMUM_VT2 floor.\n\nKPPBLD: The boundary-layer depth computation of KPP_compute_BLD (MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:1195-1575) with the CVMix OBL_depth_low interpolation and the kOBL fraction (cvmix_kpp.F90:1585-1867). Inputs are the per-column traced state: layer thicknesses h and heights dz (equal in the instrumented run: no thickness inflation, min_thickness=0), temperature/salinity/velocity T, S, U_H, V_H, the surface buoyancy flux profile buoyFlux(1..76) (from calculateBuoyancyFlux2d, buoyFlux(76) = 0), the surface friction velocity uStar and the surface pressure p_surf; outputs include the per-layer bulk Richardson numbers, the squared resolved shear and buoyancy frequency, the OBL depth and its fractional index. The EOS laws come from ./mom6_templates.esm (wright_alpha0/p0/lambda/density) with the 15 Wright coefficients declared as parameters; the pointwise KPP laws come from ./mom6_kpp_templates.esm. The N_SMOOTH=3 horizontal Laplacian smoothing of KPP_smooth_BLD is not reproduced (single-column law); OBLdepth/kOBL here are the PRE-smoothing values (mom6_kpp_obl.csv).\n\nKPPCoefs: The KPP diffusivity/viscosity/non-local coefficient computation of cvmix_coeffs_kpp_low (cvmix_kpp.F90:701-1298, not lStokesMOST) with the MOM6 wrappers of KPP_calculate (MOM_CVMix_KPP.F90:740-1067): inputs are the SMOOTHED OBLdepth/kOBL (after the N_SMOOTH=3 Laplacian of KPP_smooth_BLD, which is not reproduced here), the interface heights z_inter, uStar, the MXL_SW surface buoyancy flux surfBuoyFlux = buoyFlux(1) - buoyFlux(floor(kOBL)+1) (F90:848-853) and the incoming diffusivities Kt_in/Ks_in/Kv_in. With MATCH_TECHNIQUE=MatchGradient and ENHANCE_DIFFUSION=False, MOM6 zeroes the interior diffusivities before the CVMix call (F90:903-906), so the shape function is the no-match cubic G(sigma) = sigma*(1-sigma)^2 (G(1) = G'(1) = 0), and the overwrite loop 2..floor(kOBL) with the kwup==ktup zero restoration gives nonzero coefficients exactly on interfaces 2..floor(kOBL). KPP_IS_ADDITIVE=False: an output interface keeps the incoming value unless the KPP value is nonzero (F90:1023-1038). The non-local term is the CVMix law Tnonlocal = nonlocal_coeff*G(sigma) on interfaces 2..kwup when surfBuoyFlux < 0 (NLT_SHAPE=CVMix: MOM6 does not override), with nonlocal_coeff = Cstar*kappa*(kappa*eps*c_s)^(1/3), Cstar = 10; all traced columns are stable (surfBuoyFlux >= 0), so NLT is pinned at zero and the unstable branch is unpinned.",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM stage 2 (wt/mom6-kpp)"
  ]
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_LAYER"
  },
  "iface": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_IFACE"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_LAYER": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 75
  },
  "N_IFACE": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 76
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "KPPBLD": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./mom6_kpp_templates.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "./mom6_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "h": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer thicknesses as consumed by the pRef hydrostatic sum (F90:1439-1440), [m]"
    },
    "dz": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Layer heights used for the interface/cell geometry and the surface-layer delH (thickness_to_dz; equal to h in the instrumented run), [m]"
    },
    "T": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "degC",
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "S": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "ppt",
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "U_H": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m s^-1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "C-grid-averaged zonal velocity at T points (F90:1228-1229), [m s-1]"
    },
    "V_H": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m s^-1",
     "default": 0.0
    },
    "buoyFlux": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "iface"
     ],
     "units": "m^2 s^-3",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Surface buoyancy flux profile on interfaces, buoyFlux(76) = 0 (calculateBuoyancyFlux2d), [m2 s-3]"
    },
    "uStar": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m s^-1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Surface friction velocity (surfFricVel in MKS), [m s-1]"
    },
    "p_surf": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Surface pressure tv%p_surf, [Pa]"
    },
    "RI_CRIT": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 0.3
    },
    "VON_KARMAN": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 0.4
    },
    "SURF_LAYER_EXT": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 0.1
    },
    "MIN_OBL_DEPTH": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 5.0
    },
    "MIN_VTSQR": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2",
     "default": 1e-10
    },
    "GORHO": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^4 s^-2 kg^-1",
     "default": 0.009468599033816427,
     "description": "GoRho = g/rho0 with g = 9.8 m s-2 and rho0 = 1035 kg m-3 (GV%GoRho in MKS, Boussinesq), [m4 s-2 kg-1]"
    },
    "PRESS_STEP": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa m^-1",
     "default": 10143.0,
     "description": "g_Earth*H_to_RZ = 9.8*1035 in MKS, the hydrostatic pressure increment per metre of layer thickness (F90:1439), [Pa m-1]"
    },
    "ZETA_M": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": -0.2,
     "description": "CVMix init zeta_m (cvmix_kpp.F90:369-371), [-]"
    },
    "ZETA_S": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": -1.0,
     "description": "CVMix init zeta_s (cvmix_kpp.F90:374-377), [-]"
    },
    "A_M": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 1.2573615701844176,
     "description": "a_m = (1-16*zeta_m)^(-1/4)*(1-4*zeta_m) at zeta_m = -0.2 (cvmix_kpp.F90:370), [-]"
    },
    "C_M": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 8.382410467896117,
     "description": "c_m = (1-16*zeta_m)^(-1/4)*12 (cvmix_kpp.F90:372), [-]"
    },
    "A_S": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": -28.861739379323623,
     "description": "a_s = sqrt(1-16*zeta_s)*(1+8*zeta_s) at zeta_s = -1 (cvmix_kpp.F90:374), [-]"
    },
    "C_S": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "dimensionless",
     "default": 98.95453501482385,
     "description": "c_s = 24*sqrt(1-16*zeta_s) (cvmix_kpp.F90:376), [-]"
    },
    "a0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3 kg^-1",
     "default": 0.0007133718
    },
    "a1": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^3 kg^-1 degC^-1",
     "default": 2.72467e-07
    },
    "b0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "default": 561377000.0
    },
    "b1": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa degC^-1",
     "default": 3600337.0
    },
    "b3": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa degC^-3",
     "default": 166.0557
    },
    "b4": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa ppt^-1",
     "default": 684415.8
    },
    "b5": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa degC^-1 ppt^-1",
     "default": -8389.457
    },
    "c0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2",
     "default": 160989.3
    },
    "c1": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2 degC^-1",
     "default": 842.7815
    },
    "c3": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2 degC^-3",
     "default": 0.03869318
    },
    "c4": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2 ppt^-1",
     "default": -166.4201
    },
    "c5": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m^2 s^-2 degC^-1 ppt^-1",
     "default": -2.765195
    },
    "z_inter": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "iface"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Interface heights referenced to the surface, negative in the ocean; z_inter(1) = 0 (iFaceHeight in MKS, F90:1238-1243), [m]"
    },
    "z_cell": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Cell-center heights, negative in the ocean (cellHeight in MKS, F90:1237), [m]"
    },
    "SLdepth": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Surface-layer depth for each assumed OBL depth: SLdepth_0d = surf_layer_ext*max(max(-z_cell(k), -z_inter(2)), minOBLdepth) (F90:1346), [m]"
    },
    "delH": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "layer",
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Surface-layer thickness measure delH(k, kp) = min(max(SLdepth(k) + z_inter(kp), 0), dz(kp)); z_inter(kp) is the top interface of layer kp, so SLdepth + z_inter(kp) = SLdepth - (cumulative thickness above kp) and the closed form is bit-identical to the Fortran's running hTot accumulation (F90:1359-1375, Sterbenz: the crossing-layer sum reaches SLdepth exactly), [m]"
    },
    "surfHtemp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "layer"
     ],
     "units": "degC m",
     "default": 0.0
    },
